sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant Server as server.js
    participant Middleware as global middleware
    participant Router as route handlers
    participant Controller as auth/task/user controllers
    participant Model as Sequelize models / in-memory models
    participant Data as PostgreSQL or In-Memory store
    participant Seed as seedData.js
    participant Error as errorHandler.js

    Note over Server,Seed: Application startup
    Server->>Server: Load .env + config
    Server->>Data: Initialize database connection if DATABASE_URL exists
    alt DB configured
        Data-->>Server: PostgreSQL connection successful
        Server->>Model: Sync schema and load models
        Server->>Seed: Run seed routine
        Seed->>Model: findOrCreate roles, users, tasks
        Model->>Data: Insert or reuse records
    else No DB / invalid config
        Server->>Data: Use in-memory fallback store
        Server->>Seed: Run fallback seed routine
        Seed->>Data: Populate starter arrays
    end

    Note over Client,Error: Incoming HTTP request flow
    Client->>Server: HTTP request
    Server->>Middleware: Apply Helmet security headers, CORS, JSON parsing, and rate limiting
    Middleware->>Middleware: Validate request + JWT if protected route
    alt Token valid
        Middleware-->>Server: Attach authenticated user payload
    else Token invalid or missing
        Middleware->>Error: Generate 401 / 403 response
        Error-->>Client: Error JSON response
    end

    Server->>Router: Match URL and HTTP method
    Router->>Controller: Call controller function

    alt Requires admin or role check
        Controller->>Middleware: authorize admin role
        Middleware->>Model: Validate user role
        Model-->>Middleware: Role info
        Middleware-->>Controller: Allow or deny
    end

    Controller->>Model: Read/write task/user/role records
    alt Database mode
        Model->>Data: Query PostgreSQL tables
    else In-memory mode
        Model->>Data: Read/write arrays
    end
    Data-->>Model: Result set / records
    Model-->>Controller: Normalized model result

    alt Success path
        Controller-->>Server: JSON payload
        Server-->>Client: HTTP 200/201/204 response
    else Error path
        Controller->>Error: Pass error details
        Error-->>Client: Structured error message
    end
